  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2e965f9168c2046c28c59aa4b83cc1ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: SphereMaze
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: GravityBox.Gameplay::GravityBox.Gameplay.LevelDefinition
  Id: steel-lab-spheremaze
  DisplayIndex: 12
  DisplayName: Lost in glass
  Shape: 11
  TeachingHint: Follow the connected glass maze. Turn at the junctions and find the
    route to the green exit.
  Environment: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 82e0ce24addfe4fc89b8bbd0db998aea, type: 2}
  Prefab: {fileID: 1798800232480395504, guid: 0c9fa90a57fb0411685732707e9433e5, type: 3}
  RotationMode: 1
  InitialLocalVelocity: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  ParSeconds: 0
  Tutorial: 0
  DesignerSolution: Start inside the connected plank framework and follow its physical
    passages through turns on all three axes. Rotate the sphere to change the supporting
    face, roll along a run or fall into the next junction. Two blind branches require
    returning the way the ball entered. Sight gaps between narrow planks are smaller
    than the ball, so the outer sphere cannot be used as a shortcut. The final passage
    meets the flush round opening in the shell; the complete steel ball must leave
    through it. Route metadata is used only for authoring and tests, never to move
    or steer the ball.
